name=Talky - LibertyTalk Live Events
id=Talky
description=Your stream events become game events. LibertyTalk sends follows, subs, bits, raids, channel points and Super Chats to the Talky bridge, and the mod runs the matching workflow in the game: a zombie named after the follower, a horde for a raid, the helicopter for 1000 bits. <LINE> <LINE> Single player: the Talky bridge (Node.js 18 or later) and a public tunnel run on your PC. Server (dedicated or hosted): install Talky on the server, the admin runs the bridge next to the server and adds the streamers in game (F8 > Webhooks); a streamer installs nothing else and pastes the address and the token the admin gives into the LibertyTalk widget. Download and setup guide on GitHub. Press F8 in game to open the Talky window.
